      <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/swo_prov#GeneratorRole"/>
    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>The ontology models all supplied classes, properties, and individuals exactly as named in the atomic competency questions. Domains and ranges are aligned with the proposed axioms and Themis tests to ensure each CQ is answerable via a single property step or a clear subclass path. Data types follow XSD conventions (boolean, integer, float, dateTime, anyURI, string). Functional characteristics are applied to scalar attributes. Subclass relationships reflect deployment models, software categories, and versioning hierarchies without inventing new classes. Every named individual explicitly declares its InstanceOf class.</vaem:rationale>
</prov:Activity>

